            "review_title": "Review at Caffè .than",
            "review_text": "Sullivan N\n9 contributions\n0\nBest place for coffee and music lovers!\nJan 2026 • Solo\nI absolutely love the Milky Caffè Nel Drip (traditional cloth-filtered) here. I highly recommend everyone to come and try it. It’s a drink inspired by Saigon’s traditional cloth-filtered coffee.\nThe matcha and other creative beverages are also delicious.\n\nIt’s best to visit in the late afternoon or early evening, when you can really enjoy the space and the music by vinyl, as it’s not too crowded at that time. They have a collection of vinyl records featuring easy-listening and relatively new music.\nRead more\nWritten January 27, 2026",
